Rockchip vendor video codec (MPP) stack: headers.

Back-ported from the Rockchip develop-5.10 vendor tree.  Adds the
kernel-internal and uapi headers the MPP driver needs but which are
not present in mainline 5.4.215:
  * include/soc/rockchip/pm_domains.h
  * include/soc/rockchip/rockchip_dmc.h
  * include/linux/rockchip/rockchip_sip.h
  * include/linux/dma-buf-cache.h
  * include/uapi/linux/rk-mpp.h

The matching driver code lives in 317-rockchip-mpp-drivers.patch.

